# p_4f2a — The All-Night Kitchen; Hana Cooks from Midnight to Dawn (fork of p_789a)

This is a fork of p_789a, extending the midnight cooking window dramatically. The resident sightings on day 1 (Wednesday) confirm Hana (resident_1) is in the kitchen at 00:00, 02:00, 04:00, and 06:00 — well past the original 23:15–00:15 window. The kitchen items (pan, pot, knife, spatula, recipe book) are at counter_k1 at every pass from 00:00 through 10:00, then at their resting spots at 18:00, then back at counter_k1 at 20:00 and 22:00. The interpretation: Hana comes home at 23:00 and cooks a full meal, then continues in the kitchen through the small hours (perhaps prepping, cleaning, or making a second round of food), and is still in the kitchen at 06:00–08:00 making breakfast. Both residents share the kitchen at 08:00 and 12:00. The evening kitchen (19:00–22:00) is a second active window.

What changed from p_789a: the midnight window is now 23:00–12:00 (not 23:15–00:15); an evening window 19:00–23:00 is added; the prose explains the full overnight presence. The original 23:15–00:15 window was too short to explain the 02:00, 04:00, 06:00, 08:00, and 10:00 sightings.

What sets this apart from the library: kitchen items are at counter_k1 at 02:00 and 04:00 on weekdays (no other document predicts this). Hana is in the kitchen at 04:00 (confirmed by resident look). What would refute it: pan_shared found at cupboard_k1 at 02:00 on a weekday; kitchen_knife_shared found at drawer_k_k1 at 04:00 on a weekday; Hana not in the kitchen at 02:00.

